text = "WASD  move          Q/E  down/up
Shift sprint        Alt  slow
Mouse look          Esc  release mouse
R     ride the waves
1/2/3 weather   C  cycle weather
F     reset height

The red cube floats on the wave field
and churns foam where it meets the water."
